sequenceDiagram
    participant C as MCP Client
    participant H as handler.ts
    participant F as file-io.ts
    participant N as option-normalizer.ts
    participant U as upload-service.ts
    participant E as operation-executor.ts
    participant A as iLovePDF API
    participant R as result-builder.ts
    C->>H: tool call {sources, output_path?, options?}
    H->>H: assertCardinality(op, sources)
    H->>F: loadAllowlist() + resolveSources (path→bytes / URL passthrough)
    H->>H: requireEnv(ILOVEPDF_PUBLIC_KEY) (lazy, typed error if unset)
    H->>H: validateInputs (ext + size)
    H->>N: normalizeOptions(op, merged options) (DEC-2)
    H->>U: uploadFiles / uploadIntoSharedTask
    U->>A: auth → upload (re-auth-once + bad-node retry)
    H->>E: execute(op, creds, options)
    E->>A: process → returns download_url + sizes
    H->>R: buildToolResult
    R->>A: download produced file
    R->>F: writeOutputFile (allowlist-validated)
    R-->>H: {structuredContent, content(markdown)}
    H-->>C: CallToolResult (or isError:true typed error on failure)
